  "body": "Some people seem to read https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#dom-form-nameditem as implying that a new nodelist should be returned each time when there are multiple matching elements.  That's not the intent, I assume, and it might be worth clarifying the spec to make it clear.\r\n\r\nAll browsers I tested (Firefox, Chrome, Safari) return the same nodelist on multiple accesses.",
